Anyone with a Zenith Z150 has a program called rdcpm which comes with
the operating system which will read cpm files and transfer them to
msdos files.  The Zenith z100 also has such a program (in fact it also
has a 'rdzdos' program going the other way also) that I suppose is much
the same or identical, though I've not tried it out.  The z100 version
works well.

